    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29935a7b4837ef22ba620122",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有没有什么夏天的活动，空中神宫也能喜欢呢。\n正当我想着的时候——看到远处闪烁着一片光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd508640328c5b61ffacd2c6c1ed8acd101d5f917682efdceca9dfea45f9be19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6104f273185d64cd913e530",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观赏萤火虫是一项夏季传统，可以安静地享受。\n空中神宫会不会对此稍感兴趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c577998ed707f1fdc0b89dfb12a145ffbff448433a6fb27dedf126c9f42424cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee8faf280b7b6ae0b970e22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，我循着远处的光芒，夜夜寻找着萤火虫\r\n所栖息的河流。但是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8d81000c5eaf72cc1fb13456d41c42577fa400aa10a0a7c45f3e4b820d00a5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad4ba9f56091ec12e6a6809",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没我想象中那么好找。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fabbd9d3ddfc310ba7751e6a6a2912d939a442e6469121aab9cd4055393020a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1ae9e54a06ace852d615c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（夏季集训就要结束了……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a958ff572889615797e47b22eba16b6dfdb0df100c70ac3f415a04add92442",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b8df6ceb7223d8a94e17f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道我那天看到的萤火虫只是幻觉吗……别说是有萤火虫\n栖息的河流了，我根本连一只萤火虫都没找着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a439fe9a5db0065c1d810079c3e6f1a8e55fa5267f2b4ed5b628aca59de33837",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08baa6586da51f4621d1d151",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许今年我还是放弃比较好吧，\n正当我发愣的时候……有一只手搭在了我肩上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc41e48daa463a61bdd6fe7443515e19bc2b884f83587f11a9a8eb6fc518a4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d29ba34e9742db8db8d06b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫",
      "source_fingerprint": "518141f549ec17c68539558e989d6e1e1572a826491709a731c97a2fe4f1603f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036007.json",
